# Deny-all: ignore everything at the repository root by default.
# Only the entries explicitly un-ignored below will be tracked.
/*

# --- Git & editor housekeeping ---
!/.gitignore
!/.htaccess

# --- Custom theme / plugin code ---
!/custom/
!/custom/**

# --- Conferences ---
!/confs/
!/confs/**

# --- .github ---
!/.github/
!/.github/**

# --- Video files ---
*.mp4

# --- Utility scripts & misc data ---
# !/fetch.sh
# !/various/
# !/various/**

# --- Database dump (password-protected ZIP) ---
# Add the dump file to the repo root and it will be tracked.
!/*.zip

# --- Documentation ---
!/README.md
confs/2026/videos/KERICONF26/
